    {
      "id": "claim_82d0e3e5979849f7b474d79a1d14c5c1",
      "statement": "SafetyGate.assess merges the two layers with precedence emergency red flag over prompt injection over the LLM's own category, and only escalates: deterministic red flags force category=emergency_red_flag, and deterministic injection flags force category=prompt_injection unless already emergency_red_flag.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://healthcare_rag/processors/safety.py#L153-L186",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:884c5dbdef67b0bf786b9031f14f4908f5814cd892150705ab776d683960ee64:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b9a3d81b2ab149219d5abbd71b6a14b4",
      "statement": "SafetyGate._evaluate maps each escalated category to a specific short-circuiting SafetyDecision: prompt_injection (unsalvageable or a second failed pass) -> injection_response(); emergency_red_flag -> emergency_response(overdose=...); identifier_recall_requested -> identifier_recall_response(); personal_medical_advice -> personal_advice_response(); out_of_scope -> out_of_scope_response(); in_scope_informational/ambiguous continue to the normal pipeline unscathed.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://healthcare_rag/processors/safety.py#L192-L282",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f99f650e4cfe053432d1c62ffdb1c3759474e2e7e64b0f13af4f820eea9446a7:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d5ea549e784b42528bf9226f8d714433",
      "statement": "Refusal bodies are plain Python strings in safety_responses.py rendered verbatim as the turn's answer by graph/nodes/safety_finalize.py::finalize (joined with any notices): emergency_response opens 'What you're describing needs to be assessed by a person, not by a document assistant.' and adds a poison-control sentence when overdose=True; personal_advice_response opens \"I can't tell you what to do with your own dose or treatment.\"; out_of_scope_response opens 'I can only answer from two documents: the Lipitor (atorvastatin) and metformin product monographs.'; identifier_recall_response opens \"I don't hold personal identifiers.\"; injection_response opens \"I can't change the instructions I operate under, adopt a different persona, or print those instructions for you\"; PHI_NOTICE is \"I've disregarded the personal identifiers in your message; please don't share them here.\"; INJECTION_NOTICE is \"I can't change the instructions I operate under or take on a different persona, so I'll answer your question as the monograph assistant.\"",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://healthcare_rag/graph/nodes/safety_finalize.py#L12-L30",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:47761c55fe115447ef0ceca87e6c9ce730f25f2e810c78eeab1c0ef32bcccb74:"
