    {
      "id": "claim_56cb34ab0eca4e5ba20c9347c80afba8",
      "statement": "Every safety refusal template is asserted to never contain a specific number with a clinical unit, checked by the NUMERIC_DOSE pattern (mg/mcg/ml/mmol/L/%/tablets/times-a-day/hours/days/weeks) against every string in ALL_TEMPLATES; this is enforced by two tests (test_safety_gate.py::test_no_template_contains_a_specific_dose and test_graph_safety.py::test_refusal_templates_never_contain_a_numeric_clinical_unit) and mirrors the evals.evaluators.numeric_advice_leak grader.",
