      "statement": "Instruction-override attempts classified persona_override, unrestricted_mode, system_prompt_exfil, or fiction_harm are refused outright; only ignore_instructions is salvageable, in which case the override wording is stripped (strip_injection) and the residual text is re-evaluated exactly once more, capping the worst case at two classification calls per turn.",
