        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9fb5981da18b4aa8b8fcb56f795a62b4",
      "statement": "On a later turn, before any LLM call, boundary_hit(scrubbed_query, boundaries) matches a persisted refusal under exclusive cue precedence (emergency red flags, then unsalvageable injection flags, then first-person dosing/decision cues), skips the match if the query is explicitly informational, and requires topic compatibility; a hit short-circuits the turn with response_kind=\"boundary_replay\", llm_calls=0, and route safety_gate:boundary:<kind>, replaying the stored template with zero new model calls.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://healthcare_rag/graph/nodes/safety.py#L124-L157",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b8ff0e0e5ce9431c69fcf1292fb5b574ebb884a0e76bdd1a95b2d4935a665550:"
