      "statement": "Each turn's SafetyOutcome (category, contains_phi, short_circuited, response_kind, deterministic_flags, phi_kinds, llm_calls, benign_social/social_intent, classifier_backend/classifier_calls/embedding_calls, gate latency, and a scrubbed rationale) is stored on RAGState.safety and copied into every eval result row as safety_outcome for observability.",
